Changes in this derivative, which are also distributed under the MIT License:

- Retarget the solution from net10.0 to net8.0, including SDK pin and
  NuGet packages that restore and compile on the .NET 8 SDK.
- Add a CPU-only inference path for Qwen2.5-0.5B (LLamaSharp / llama.cpp,
  GpuLayerCount = 0, no CUDA backend).
- Add a CPU-only LoRA training path for Qwen2.5-0.5B. The .NET process
  orchestrates an external Python trainer (transformers + peft by default,
  LLaMA-Factory as an alternative). Training is not implemented in-process
  in C#.

